# #148 Devotion Aura and #144 special cues: Uther's passive fills on three blocked hits and softens the next launch; every special form shows its Warcraft spell.
# Uther a against Uther b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero uther
# #148: b walks in with forward tilts; a's shield blocks three, then a lowers it and the next lands softened. Then b walks away.
40 b press LB
40 b stick -1 0
60 a shield 1
95 b tap A 2
112 a capture
145 b tap A 2
162 a capture
195 b tap A 2
212 a capture
222 a shield 0
250 b tap A 2
263 a capture
275 b stick 1 0
